---
import Container from '../ui/Container.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import StoryVisual from '../ui/StoryVisual.astro';
import Section from '../ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section id="story" background>
  <Container>
    <SectionHeading badge="Our Story" title="Why Grovera Exists" />

    <div class="mt-10 grid items-center gap-10 sm:mt-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
      <!-- LEFT -->

      <div
        class="space-y-6 text-base leading-7 sm:space-y-8 text-text-muted sm:text-lg sm:leading-8"
      >
        <p>
          Grovera was not built because the world needed another marketing agency. It was built
          because we believed businesses deserved another way to grow.
        </p>

        <p>
          While working in the marketing industry, we saw businesses feeling pressured to follow
          approaches that did not always align with their values. We believed there was a better way
          — a way where success did not require compromise.
        </p>

        <p>
          That belief became Grovera: a Shariah-compliant marketing agency that brings together
          strategy, creativity, and professionalism while remaining rooted in Islamic values.
        </p>

        <p class="font-medium text-text">
          Because to us, success is not only about achieving results. It is about achieving them the
          right way.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT -->

      <StoryVisual />
    </div>
  </Container>
</Section>
